+/*
+ * G.I. Joe: vehicle specials (VEHICLE_SPECIALS_v1; BUILD-2). See VehicleSpecials.h.
+ * "Until its next turn" effects store the battle turn they were used on; "armed" specials wait in vsArm:<unit> for
+ * the vehicle's next shot.
+ */
