+/**
+ * Draws the situation board: the player's own pins and routes, and the leads
+ * intel has given him, on the same pass and in the same vocabulary.
+ *
+ * Intel ages. A lead older than MARK_STALE_MONTHS is DRAWN one tier less
+ * certain than it was filed - a confirmed sighting becomes a likely one,
+ * a likely one becomes a rumour - without the stored mark being rewritten.
+ * Drawing it down rather than editing it means the player can still be told
+ * what he was originally told, and a fresh confirmation restores it by
+ * changing placedMonth rather than by repairing damage.
+ *
+ * A pin the player placed himself never goes stale. He is not guessing about
+ * his own guess.
+ */
